<< /A 393 0 R /Alt (Diagram illustrating a study protocol comparing pre- and post-intervention effects of a 24-week MBE program on acute heart rate variability reactivity, involving rest, a two-minute step test, and recovery phases.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 16 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
