24 0 obj
<< /A 394 0 R /Alt (Nine-panel line chart compares standardized units of heart rate variability and stress indices at baseline and post-intervention, showing mean estimates with error bars across pre and post-TMST exercise testing for RMSSD, SDNN, Mean R-R, HF, LF, VLF, PNS, SNS, and Stress. Blue circles represent baseline, pink triangles represent post-intervention, with data adjusted for confounding factors.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 19 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
